  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Masimanyane Girls Soccer Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to contribute towards the prevention of gender-based violence and femicide (GBVF) in South Africa. The approach is to build social cohesion by using girl&#x2019;s soccer to create safe spaces for healthy and purposeful participation of girls, as well as engaging the broader communities the girls come from in the fight against GBVF. The project will further the whole-of-society approach outlined in South Africa&#x2019;s National Strategic Plan on GBVF. The aim is to ensure that everyone is involved in addressing GBVF in a systematic, holistic and comprehensive manner.</narrative>
  </description>
